doc:Factsrms_3 schema:description "The main contributions of this work are: Implementation of uncertainty quantification to improve decision reliability; Development of a one-class hybrid model combining ICA and Bayesian LSTM for bearing anomaly detection; Use of dynamic thresholding for adaptive anomaly scoring without parameter tuning; Achieving 100% recall on fault conditions and 99.1% overall accuracy, demonstrating superior performance compared to conventional methods." .
